      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm a high school debate coach getting a student ready for a big tournament. The topic is Universal Basic Income. I really need to prep them for the opposition side. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and provide the most devastating rebuttals possible?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
